  "section": null,
  "number": "31",
  "title": "恒等式$(\\sqrt{a})^2=a$（$a\\geqslant0$）",
  "printed_title": "31. 恒等式$(\\sqrt{a})^2=a$（$a\\geqslant0$）",
  "start_page": 205,
  "start_printed": 199,
  "figures": [],
  "exercise_count": 7,
  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "根据算术平方根的定义，根式$\\sqrt{a}$（$a>0$）的值是非负数，它的平方等于$a$. 因此，对于任何非负数$a$来说，下列等式成立：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 199,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0205#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$(\\sqrt{a})^2=a$.　（1）",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 199,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0205#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "在非负数集上（1）式是一个恒等式.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 199,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0205#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "利用恒等式（1），可以把任何一个非负数写成某个数的平方，例如：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 199,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0205#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$2=(\\sqrt{2})^2$，$0.5=(\\sqrt{0.5})^2$，$\\frac{1}{7}=\\left(\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{7}}\\right)^2$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 199,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0205#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们举两个应用恒等式（1）作变形的例子.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 199,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0205#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例1　求$(0.1\\sqrt{18})^2$的值.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 199,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0205#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "根据积的幂的性质，得",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 199,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0205#11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$(0.1\\sqrt{18})^2=(0.1)^2\\cdot(\\sqrt{18})^2$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 199,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0205#12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "因为$(\\sqrt{18})^2=18$，所以$(0.1)^2\\cdot(\\sqrt{18})^2=0.01\\times18=0.18$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 199,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0205#13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "所以，$(0.1\\sqrt{18})^2=0.18$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 199,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0205#14"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例2　化简分式$\\frac{x^2-3}{x+\\sqrt{3}}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 200,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0206#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "将分式的分子写成平方差的形式：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 200,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0206#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$x^2-3=x^2-(\\sqrt{3})^2$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 200,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0206#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "于是",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 200,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0206#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\frac{x^2-3}{x+\\sqrt{3}}=\\frac{x^2-(\\sqrt{3})^2}{x+\\sqrt{3}}=\\frac{(x+\\sqrt{3})(x-\\sqrt{3})}{x+\\sqrt{3}}=x-\\sqrt{3}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 200,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0206#5"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
